'
' tkCodeEdit -- a Scintilla editor as a tkControls widget. A port of PsPlatform's PsSciView
' (+ PsSciInput, PsSciClipboard, PsSciNotify): the editor is Scintilla 5.5.7 + Lexilla in the
' scintk shared library (scintk/), loaded at run time; this module is its host.
'
' THE HOST OWNS THE PIXELS. scintk draws through two tables registered here -- text (TkTeApi,
' over SDL_ttf) and shapes (TkDrawApi, over SDL_Renderer) -- into the widget's OWN render-target
' texture, TKCE_TARGET "view". Scintilla repaints that texture only when it asked to (its
' invalidate callback) or the size changed; every frame in between blits it in one call. That
' is what keeps a caret blink from re-laying-out the document. Pixmaps Scintilla allocates
' (line buffers are off: SCI_SETBUFFEREDDRAW 0; the fold hatching, marker images) are more
' render-target textures.
'
' THE LIBRARY IS LOADED, NOT LINKED (SDL_LoadObject): scintk.dll / libscintk.so beside the
' program, so a host that never makes an editor never needs it, and nothing C++ reaches the
' tiko link. tkCodeEdit_LibraryError says why a load failed.
'
' THE POPUPS ARE THE HOST'S: Scintilla's autocompletion list (its ListBox model, scintk's Lb*)
' and its call tip (SciTk_PaintCallTip) are tkHost POPUP surfaces, made per show because Wayland
' fixes a popup's position when it is created; the context menu is a tkPopupMenu. A popup takes
' the keyboard on Linux, so each forwards keys to its editor, and the editor ignores the focus
' loss its own popup causes (PsSciInput's g_sciAcOwner rule).
'
' FONTS are files: tkCodeEdit_SetFontFace maps a family name (what SCI_STYLESETFONT names) to
' its regular / bold / italic files, tkCodeEdit_SetFallbackFonts names the faces a glyph the
' primary lacks is taken from. IME composition is ScintillaGTK's inline pre-edit. Each editor
' keeps its own DPI and restyles on TKM_SCALECHANGED.
#module "tkCodeEdit"

#import "std/containers"
#import "../tkHost" public
#import "../tkTheme" public
#import "../tkPopupMenu"
using containers
using tkHost
using tkPopupMenu
using tkPaint
using tkTheme

' ---- scintk's C ABI (scintk/scintk.h) -------------------------------------------------------
public const TKCE_ABI_VERSION = 2

